"lanetledi", "fr": "Il a maudit", "id": "Dia melaknat", "ur": "اس نے لعنت کی", "bn": "তিনি লানত করেছেন", "fa": "لعنت کرد"}}, {"text": "ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَعَدَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَعِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "4:52", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/545.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Those are they whom Allah hath cursed, and he whom Allah hath cursed, thou (O Muhammad) wilt find for him no helper.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onlar, Allah'ın lanet ettiği kimselerdir. Allah kime lanet ederse artık ona asla bir yardımcı bulamazsın.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "یہ ہیں جن پر اللہ نے لعنت کی اور جسے خدا لعنت کرے تو ہر گز اسکا کوئی یار نہ پائے گا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka itulah orang yang dikutuki Allah. Barangsiapa yang dikutuki Allah, niscaya kamu sekali-kali tidak akan memperoleh penolong baginya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَعَنَهُمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a1e2249f5b0aea5ac781.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "prokleo ih je", "en": "He cursed them", "tr": "onları lanetledi", "fr": "Il les a maudits", "id": "Dia melaknat mereka", "ur": "اس نے ان پر لعنت کی", "bn": "তিনি তাদের লানত করেছেন", "fa": "آنان را لعنت کرد"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَلْعَنِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/22d22dfd405282d83cb2.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "prokune", "en": "He curses", "tr": "lanetler", "fr": "Il maudit", "id": "Dia melaknat", "ur": "وہ لعنت کرے", "bn": "তিনি লানত করেন", "fa": "لعنت می‌کند"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَلَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَجِدَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَصِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "33:68", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3601.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Our Lord! Oh, give them double torment and curse them with a mighty curse.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey Rabbimiz! Onlara azabın iki katını ver ve kendilerini büyük bir lânet ile lânetle.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے ہمارے رب! انہیں آگ کا دُونا عذاب دے اور ان پر بڑی لعنت کر،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Ya Tuhan kami, timpakanlah kepada mereka azab dua kali lipat dan kutuklah mereka dengan kutukan yang besar\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "رَبَّنَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَاتِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ضِعْفَيْنِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَذَابِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱلْعَنْهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8f03ca69ea30a21d9c69.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i prokuni ih", "en": "and curse them", "tr": "ve onları lanetle", "fr": "et maudis-les", "id": "dan laknatlah mereka", "ur": "اور ان پر لعنت کر", "bn": "এবং তাদের লানত করো", "fa": "و آنان را لعنت کن"}}, {"text": "لَعْنًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null},